note">名字就是钥匙：别人输一样的名字就能进同一个营地。</p>\r\n        <p class="camp-current"><span id="campCurrent">你当前在主营地</span> <button id="campBack" type="button" hidden>回主营地</button></p>\r\n        <p id="startStatus" role="status">正在连接世界…</p>\r\n      </section>\r\n      <section class="start-card compare" aria-labelledby="startCompareTitle">\r\n        <h2 id="startCompareTitle">A/B 对照模式</h2>\r\n        <p>从同一个起点出发，观察内部状态通道开关如何影响居民的选择。</p>\r\n        <div class="start-actions">\r\n          <button id="startCompare" type="button" disabled>进入对照</button>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n      <details class="start-guide"><summary>玩法指引</summary>\r\n        <div>\r\n          <p>采集木石、修建住所、耕作与储粮。居民会根据需求、信任和天气决定是否协助。</p>\r\n          <p>WASD 移动 · Shift 奔跑 · 1–8 选工具 · F 交互 · E 背包。靠近居民时可空手交谈。</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </details>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <figure class="start-cover" aria-label="黄昏聚落">\r\n      <canvas id="startScene" aria-hidden="true" width="640" height="520"></canvas>\r\n    </figure>\r\n  </div>\r\n</main>\r\n\r\n<header>\r\n  <h1>拥爱生命实验室<span id="tagline">无尽生存 · 在荒野与居民共同生活 ｜ 长期经营：维持食物、住所和生态，应对四季与灾害 ｜ 与居民同一套存续规则：不吃饭会死</span></h1>\r\n  <div id="backend" class="backend">后端：读取中…</div>\r\n</header>\r\n<div id="mapbar">\r\n  <button id="btnMenu" type="button">主菜单</button>\r\n  <div id="minimap" hidden></div>\r\n  <span class="lbl" id="visionInfo" hidden></span>\r\n  <span id="ctlCluster">\r\n    <button id="btnRun" class="on">▶ 运行</button>\r\n    <button id="btnStep">单步</button>\r\n    <button id="btnSleep" class="solo-only" title="假装容器休眠 45 分钟">休眠 45 分钟</button>\r\n    <button id="btnReset" class="compare-only">重跑对照</button>\r\n    <button id="btnCompareSnapshot" class="compare-only">用当前生存快照</button>\r\n    <button id="btnBrain" class="solo-only" title="切换内心来源">内心：本地替身</button>\r\n    <button id="btnM3" class="compare-only" title="M3 目标承诺层（默认关）">M3 承诺期</button>\r\n    <button id="btnM4" class="compare-only" title="M4 耦合调制权（默认关）">M4 耦合调制</button>\r\n  </span>\r\n  <span class="spacer"></span>\r\n  <button id="btnCampAngle" type="button" hidden>转视角</button>\r\n  <span id="campSunPhase" class="surv-only" aria-label="光照时段" hidden></span>\r\n  <button id="btnOverview" title="切换局部放大视角 / 完整世界全景">世界全景</button>\r\n  <button id="btnFull" title="把整张世界地图铺满屏幕（Esc 退出）">⛶ 全屏</button>\r\n  <button id="btnSurv" type="button" aria-pressed="false">生存游玩</button>\r\n  <button id="btnAudio" type="button" aria-pressed="true" title="声音：点击在 高 / 中 / 低 / 关 之间循环" aria-label="声音档位"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="26" height="26" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.4 4.6h1.7L6.7 2.4v7.2L4.1 7.4H2.4z" fill="#D8A667"/><path class="wave" d="M8 4.3q1.2 1.7 0 3.4M9.4 3.2q2 2.8 0 5.6" stroke="#9DA8A8" fill="none" stroke-width=".8"/><path class="mute" d="M8.2 4.4l2.2 2.4M10.4 4.4L8.2 6.8" stroke="#C0504D" stroke-width=".9"/></svg></button>\r\n  <button id="btnBagTop" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" hidden>背包（E）</button>\r\n  <button id="btnCompare" type="button" aria-pressed="false">研究对照 A/B</button>\r\n  <details id="keysHelp" hidden><summary>按键</summary>\r\n    <div>WASD/方向键 走路 · Shift 奔跑 · 1–8 选工具 · E 背包 · 靠近居民空手按 F 交谈（重工具会击伤） · 点家具走近使用 · 到门口进入 · Esc 关闭面板</div>\r\n  </details>\r\n</div>\r\n<section id="playNotice" role="status" aria-live="polite">\r\n  <p id="playNoticeText">正在连接生存世界…</p>\r\n  <a id="playPreviewLink" hidden>打开本机新版生存试玩</a>\r\n</section>\r\n<div id="hudGauges" class="surv-only" role="status" aria-label="聚落资源仪表"></div>\r\n<main id="worldMain" class="solo" hidden>\r\n  <div class="col">\r\n    <div class="world side-a">\r\n      <div id="hotbar" class="surv-only" role="toolbar" aria-label="工具栏">\r\n        <button class="slot on" data-tool="hand" title="空手（1）：公仓存取 / 查看">手<i>1</i></button>\r\n        <button class="slot" data-tool="axe" title="斧（2）：到伐木林砍木">斧<i>2</i></button>\r\n        <button class="slot" data-tool="pick" title="镐（3）：采石（瞭台/井台）">镐<i>3</i></button>\r\n        <button class="slot" data-tool="hoe" title="锄（4）：收获/播种（菜园）">锄<i>4</i></butt